  "summary": {
    "headline": "Manuscript Index and Affiliations",
    "text": "Index of manuscripts for the Consensus Numerorum, mapping Marcianus manuscripts 303, 335, 313, 336, 314, 366, 323, 594, 324, Cl. VI, 4, and 334 to catalog codes 1–11. Notes identify Bessarion as a codex owner, manuscript dates from 1416 to 1585, and textual affinities among Venetian, Florentine, and Parisian codices."
